title: 'sc-dkg: aggregatable DKG gadget over BEEFY BLS keys (prototype)'

doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      Adds `sc-dkg`, a prototype gadget for an aggregatable distributed key generation
      (a-DKG, `adkg-vrf`) among validators that reuses their paired ECDSA,BLS12-381 BEEFY
      keys. At each session change the node deals, gossips signed dealings with
      session-scoped validation, and hands its own dealing to a pluggable submitter, which
      sends it to a pallet that aggregates the dealings into a per-session threshold key.
      Experimental: test-network only, not wired into the polkadot node yet.

crates:
  - name: sc-dkg
    bump: major
